WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.605 --> 00:00:10.506
Green: booked. Spoi's session and a
TermTime booking match.

2
00:00:10.606 --> 00:00:15.507
Each box: the session's name,
then its room and weeks.

3
00:00:15.607 --> 00:00:22.509
* after the name: Samhliða – one of
several groups; each student attends one.

4
00:00:22.609 --> 00:00:27.510
The booking's activity ID links the two.

5
00:00:27.610 --> 00:00:32.513
Blue: a session with no booking
in TermTime yet.

6
00:00:32.613 --> 00:00:37.514
Orange: a TermTime booking
with no session in Spoi.

7
00:00:37.614 --> 00:00:44.515
“Búa til tíma” makes a session of it;
“Fjarlægja bókun” deletes it in TermTime.

8
00:00:44.615 --> 00:00:51.517
Purple: booked, but changed since –
it needs rebooking (see 1c).

9
00:00:51.617 --> 00:00:57.520
“Ekki tímasett” (not scheduled):
sessions with no time yet.

10
00:01:01.624 --> 00:01:08.526
Solid: teaching weeks. Dashed: a one-off
session that week. Striped: no sessions.

11
00:01:08.626 --> 00:01:15.526
One-off weeks start unselected, so the
regular week shows; click to see them.

12
00:01:15.626 --> 00:01:22.528
Press and drag across chips
to set several at once.

13
00:01:27.629 --> 00:01:33.529
On a busier course, the pills appear
a moment after it loads.

14
00:01:33.629 --> 00:01:39.529
Red: students who also have another
course at that time.

15
00:01:39.629 --> 00:01:45.532
The yellow box reports the status
of the session's current position.

16
00:01:45.632 --> 00:01:52.533
“14x6/15”: 14 students, 6 of 15 weeks –
and which of its sessions is in the way.

17
00:01:52.633 --> 00:01:58.535
Amber ⛔: the room is booked in TermTime –
booking would fail.

18
00:01:58.635 --> 00:02:03.536
Amber ⚠: another course has the room
in Núverandi lausn.

19
00:02:03.636 --> 00:02:09.539
Purple: a teacher who teaches
elsewhere at that time.

20
00:02:09.639 --> 00:02:16.541
Filters narrow the course list – “Námskeið
án tíma”: courses with no session yet.
